    "mods": {},
    "biography": "<p><strong>Morph:</strong> Bouncer</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Blades 50, Clubs 50, Deception 45, Fray 50, Free Fall 60, Freerunning 40, Intimidation 50, Infosec 40, Interest: Ego Markets 40, Interfacing 40, Kinetic Weapons 55, Perception 40, Profession: Slaver 40, Spray Weapons 55</p><p><strong>Implants:</strong> Basic Biomods, Basic Mesh Inserts, Cortical Stack, Grip Pads, Prehensile Feet</p><p><strong>melee:</strong> Vibroblade 50 (AP −2, DV 2d10 + 1)</p><p><strong>ranged:</strong> Medium Rail Pistol 55 (AP −5, DV 2d10 + 4)</p><p>1 in 4 have, instead:</p><p><strong>melee:</strong> Shock Baton 50 (DV 1d10 + 4 + shock)</p><p><strong>ranged:</strong> Shard Pistol 55 (AP −10, DV 1d10 + 6, Mode SA/BF/FA, Ammo 100)</p><p><strong>Armor:</strong> 7/7 (Standard Vacsuit) PROFESSIONAL MERCENARY VARIANT</p><p><strong>Additional Implants:</strong> Neurachem (Level 1), Medichines</p><p><strong>ranged:</strong> Automatic Rail Rifle 50 (AP −9, DV 2d10 + 8, Mode SA/BF/FA, Ammo 30) with Smartlink</p><p><strong>Armor:</strong> 17/15 (Heavy Body Armor w/ Ablative Patches)</p><p><em>Printed: INIT 7, SPD 1, LUC 30, TT 6, IR 60, DUR 35, WT 7, DR 52.</em></p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase The Devotees, p. 26.</em></p>",
